prebsd - INSTALL
===============

prebsd is a C program (the fetch and console driver) with a few scripts.

Requirements:
  * a C compiler, libcurl and json-c with pkg-config to build it
  * simh: ./build-simh builds the ones prebsd needs (git, make, python3), or `pdp11` on the PATH
  * curl, python3 (3.6+) for the fetch script

Build and install:

    ./configure            # sets the PREFIX
    make                   # builds prebsd
    ./build-simh           # builds the simulators into simh/bin/
    make install           # installs prebsd, fetch, build-simh and the ini/ under PREFIX

Or just run in place:

    ./prebsd v7-pcollinson 'ls /'
